// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : FreedomCorp_Liason 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Glacia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3101451524" "Glacia"
// ProfessionString :
"P2055520075" "Omega Team Survivor"
// DescriptionString :
"P3368146597" "Glacia and her twin sister Infernia spent years battling each other before the Rikti attacked. United for the first time, they fought side-by-side and together volunteered to join the Omega team. Like all members of the Omega team, their fate had been a mystery until they were rescued by Lady Grey and a team of super-powered individuals.<br><br>Glacia is now back in the field, providing support for Back Alley Brawler and the Freedom Phalanx."
// LocationString :
"P891522995" "Peregrine Island"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3282034855" "<color orange>You need to purchase the fifth episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play Glacia's story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P793719432" "{HeroName}, I'm Glacia. I know you, and now you know me, if you didn't already. Let's cut to the chase. Back Alley Brawler asked me to help him track down Statesman and Darrin Wade.<br><br>He wants me to stay here in Paragon and provide support, while the two of you look for Wade's lair in the Isles. Now, I disagree with Brawler's idea that I'm not ready for field work, but this isn't the time to argue when Wade is on the loose.<br><br>If you're ready, I'll give you the rundown on the situation. Hopefully at the end of all this, we'll have Wade in the Zig and Statesman back where he belongs.<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses, which may be difficult to defeat by yourself.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P4148663305" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but you need to be at least security level 40 to handle this."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P400090994" "I don't have time to talk with you, bring me your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2921966128" "You need everyone on your team in the same area before we can get going."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2687958691" "Someone in your team isn't strong enough to handle this task."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P4073723196" "We don't have time to waste, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


