// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Michael Binocolo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2726739065" "Michael Binocolo"
// ProfessionString :
"P1673545807" "Luddite Crusader"
// DescriptionString :
"P2352082882" "Michael Binocolo is one of the more level-headed members of the Luddites, a group of crusaders based in Cap au Diable.<br><br>He has travelled to Paragon City in order to speak with the Midnight Squad; he has said that they avoided the entrance in Mercy to ensure Aeon and Arachnos did not know about the deal they were trying to make with the group."
// LocationString :
"P3637129972" "Talos Island"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4279137415" "<color orange>You need to purchase the second episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die, Episode 2</i>, or be a VIP in order to play Michael Binocolo's story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3953262263" "Hello, {HeroName}. My name is Michael Binocolo, a recently recruited member of the <color yellow>Luddites</color>. For years, the Luddites have rallied against the evils of <color yellow>Dr. Aeon</color>. But now, we seek to become members of the fabled <color yellow>Midnight Squad</color>.<br><br>I am here acting as an ambassador, to show them that the Luddites would be reliable allies. However, the Midnight Squad have requested that we choose a hero, or group of heroes, to act as our representatives.<br><br>They have heard that the Luddites are... difficult to work with. I would like to request you to represent the Luddites in speaking with the Midnighters. Will you accept?<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses and may be difficult for certain players to do by themselves.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2609150223" "My apologies, but you'll need to be of at least security level 20 before you and I can work together."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2250064636" "I must speak with the one who is the leader of your group."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3573373804" "All the members of your group must be in this area before we can begin."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1803920314" "There is a member of your team who is not powerful enough to deal with these current matters."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P470576664" "No time like the present, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


