// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : PPD_Contact 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Specialist Greer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1369930705" "Specialist Greer"
// ProfessionString :
"P2656720253" "PPD Hardsuit Specialist"
// DescriptionString :
"P2022793618" "Specialist Greer is one of the best pilots the PPD has to offer when it comes to Hardsuits. Greer was a former detective who showed surprisingly high scores on the tests to pilot the high-tech PPD Hardsuit. He is extremely capable and willing to do whatever it takes to help the heroes of the city get the job done."
// LocationString :
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2170081422" "<color orange>You need to purchase the sixth episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play Specialist Greer's story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3576172172" "Hey, {HeroName}, glad to see you're here. We've got a major situation that we need your help in handling. Sister Psyche's condition is getting worse by the minute. The portion of Aurora Borealis that is trapped within her mind is growing more powerful, causing Sister Psyche's control over her powers to, well, go wild.<br><br>Manticore has been... well, difficult to work with, at best. We may have a lead on how to actually cure Psyche, but it's not going to be easy.<br><br>This is why we called you. I won't be much help from my hardsuit, given this is a psychic matter. You're more versatile than I am... well, until I get a promotion to hero status. But that's neither here nor there.<br><br>If you're ready, I've got the debriefing on the situation and how we can handle this.<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses, which may be difficult to defeat by yourself.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1481545019" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but we need someone of at least security level 40 to handle this scenario."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P875933811" "I'm only authorized to speak with the leader of your team."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P4233582490" "Everyone in your team needs to be assembled before we can begin."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P196129391" "Someone on your squad isn't at least security level 40. Everyone needs to be prepared for this situation."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2919760286" "Time's wasting, {HeroName}. Sister Psyche needs our help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


