// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Theoden 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1637363908" "Theoden"
// ProfessionString :
"P2000998805" "Lost Pariah"
// DescriptionString :
"P841568039" "The being known as Theoden was recently captured by the PPD during a raid on a Lost warehouse.<br><br>After a day within a cell in Skyway, he demanded to speak to you, saying that he needed the help of a hero to save both the Lost and Paragon City."
// LocationString :
"P2588402137" "Skyway PPD Precinct"
// CallTextOverride :
"P1797837334" "Contact via PPD Radio"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4261564328" "<color orange>You need to purchase the first episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, or be a VIP in order to play Theoden's story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P4019343423" "{HeroName}. I am <color yellow>Theoden</color> of the Lost. Normally, you and I would be enemies.<br><br>But today, we are allies against my former friends. There are members of the Lost who are going against what is... right. Your PPD have allowed me to work with you to stop this.<br><br>As you can see, I am currently in full custody of your PPD. I am helping you because our ways require it.<br><br>What these Lost are doing goes against the laws that have been handed down to us, against the goals that we promote.<br><br>I believe that, in this instance, your help will aid the greater good, if you can believe that."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1198474651" "I have nothing to say to the likes of you."
// NeedLargeTeam :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P310510049" "I will only speak to the one who leads your company."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2278294521" "Gather all your cohorts to speak with me, {HeroName}."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1530983829" "One among you is not powerful enough to stem the tide that will be coming."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2268196013" "We have much to do."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


